+For the ARM64 Lidar target:
+
+```sh
+make O=/path/to/kernel-output ARCH=arm64 CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu- \
+  LD=aarch64-linux-gnu-ld.bfd mt8167_arm64_defconfig
