+  LD=aarch64-linux-gnu-ld.bfd Image dtbs -j8
+```
+
+The ARM32 build writes `arch/arm/boot/zImage`. The ARM64 build writes
+`arch/arm64/boot/Image`. Both write the target DTB under
+`arch/<arch>/boot/dts/`.
